ARTEX Offline is a derivative work ("fork") of ARTEX, focused on operation in
closed / air-gapped (offline) environments. It adds, on top of upstream:

  - offline / local-LLM-only mode with egress gates on the agent's outbound
    paths, an in-container egress firewall overlay, and refusal of package
    installs in agent shells;
  - an offline knowledge base: signed knowledge packs (ExploitDB, NVD,
    technique docs) with lexical and optional vector hybrid search, exposed to
    the agents as a local substitute for web search.

